## Analysis

This issue is a reproduction of the original issue #788. The error occurs when the conversation context approaches 100% capacity, and the LLM provider rejects the message due to an invalid part type 'video_url' at position 1 with role 'user'.

This appears to be related to context management in the LLM provider, potentially a bug in how the Kimi Code CLI handles context limit warnings or compactions.


